    ["　　好久不见。\n　　自廷根湖异变后，值夜者封锁了廷根湖边区域处理遗留的污染，目前已经处理完毕，重新解除了封锁。\n　　不过最近巡逻的同事告诉我，湖边近日忽然多了几张桌椅和帐篷，应该解除封锁后，有人来到这边进行了活动。\n　　保险起见，值夜者需要调查来到这边的人是否安全。如果你有时间的话，我希望你可以来廷根湖这边协助我们调查。\n　　新同事，期待着与你再一次见面。"] = "Long time no see. \n Since the Tingen Lake anomaly, the Nighthawks have sealed off the area by Tingen Lake to handle the residual corruption. It has now been processed, and the blockade has been lifted. \n However, colleagues on patrol recently told me that a few tables, chairs, and tents have suddenly appeared by the lake. It seems someone has been active here since the blockade was lifted. \n To be safe, the Nighthawks need to investigate whether the people who came here are safe. If you have time, I hope you can come to Tingen Lake to assist us with the investigation. \n New colleague, looking forward to seeing you again.",
